chapters:
@cloud
A universal version for inspections, documentation, photography, reporting and teamwork.
@pro
All core Cloud features plus the dedicated wet-room waterproofing inspection report (Valvontapöytäkirja), developed with Finnish Eurofins Expert Services requirements in mind.
@end
Both versions allow free professional document creation without mandatory registration.

@languages
# Independent document language
For example, use the English interface and create PDFs in Finnish. Select the language at the top of the report editor. Standard field and section labels are generated in the selected PDF language. Manually entered text is not translated automatically.
